 1 adding a user : curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"ali","password":"ali123"}'

2 logging in a user : curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username":"anas","password":"anas123"}'

3 setting a token : TOKEN="yahan-token-paste-karo"

4 Adding a new student : curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/students \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -d '{"name":"Bilal Ahmed","email":"bilal@test.com","age":22,"course":"Computer Science"}'



5 Adding multiple students :

First generate a script file : nano ~/add_students.sh

than copy and paste this code : #!/bin/bash

names=("Hamza Ali" "Ayesha Khan" "Usman Tariq" "Fatima Noor" "Bilal Ahmed")
emails=("hamza@test.com" "ayesha@test.com" "usman@test.com" "fatima@test.com" "bilal@test.com")
ages=(20 21 22 23 24)
courses=("CS" "SE" "IT" "AI" "DS")

for i in {0..4}; do
  curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/students \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
    -d "{\"name\":\"${names[$i]}\",\"email\":\"${emails[$i]}\",\"age\":${ages[$i]},\"course\":\"${courses[$i]}\"}"
  echo ""
done

echo "Done! 5 students added."

than press control+O press enter and than press control+x to exit

than create an executable : chmod +x ~/add_students.sh

and run : ~/add_students.sh

it would add the five students.


6 to search all students search :	curl http://localhost:8080/api/students \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN"

7 to search a single student : curl http://localhost:8080/api/students/1 \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN"

8 to update a student use : curl -X PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/1 \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" \
  -d '{"name":"Anas Khan","email":"anas@test.com","age":21,"course":"Software Engineering"}'

9 to delete a student : curl -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1 \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN"



